<rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:TPM="http://texlive.dante.de/"><rdf:Description about="http://www.miktex.org/packages/fontaxes"><TPM:Name>fontaxes</TPM:Name><TPM:Creator>mpc</TPM:Creator><TPM:Title>Additional font selection axes for LaTeX</TPM:Title><TPM:Version>2.0.2</TPM:Version><TPM:TargetSystem minVersion=""></TPM:TargetSystem><TPM:Description>The package adds several new font axes on top of LaTeX’s New Font Selection Scheme. In particular, it splits the shape axis into a primary and a secondary shape axis, and it adds three new axes to deal with the different figure versions offered by many professional fonts. This package has nowadays been deprecated in favour of the figureversions package.</TPM:Description><TPM:RunFiles size="17345">texmf\tex\latex\fontaxes\fontaxes-v1.sty texmf\tex\latex\fontaxes\fontaxes.sty</TPM:RunFiles><TPM:TimePackaged>1768131165</TPM:TimePackaged><TPM:MD5>ea9d85238bf546424b899d0544499dce</TPM:MD5><TPM:CTAN path="/macros/latex/contrib/fontaxes"/><TPM:Copyright owner="Andreas Buehmann" year="2007"/><TPM:License type="lppl1.3c"/></rdf:Description></rdf:RDF>